WEBVTT

00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:12,180
So what should prevention really look like?

00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:18,540
Well, prevention has to be geared on diet, and it has to be geared on lifestyle.

00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:25,580
So it's, I mean, that's really the bottom line is what we're choosing, how we're choosing

00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,580
to live.

00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:33,420
The issue, the problem is that we live in a world that's corrupt and it's poisoned, you know,

00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:39,220
this was not dyed with blueberries, and so I'm exposed to chemicals just sitting here.

00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:43,940
We can't get away from that, but we can make wise choices.

00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:52,500
Unfortunately, we live in a society that Bon Santo is the good guy and we're addicted

00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,100
to fast foods.

00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:58,500
So it has to come from a consumer-driven approach.

00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:05,940
I mean, the whole, look at the organic market today, 10 years ago, it didn't really exist,

00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:11,180
you know, and now it is completely commodity-driven.

00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:16,500
So that's what we need to do at a grassroots basis of getting people to make proper choices

00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:18,140
so that that will drive the market.

